Subject: [PATCH 3/4] item 1 fixes: case-insensitive fence tags, and decline
 non-expressions

Both found by running a real model against the shipped build.

- the tag match was case-sensitive, so ```LaTeX fell through to a code
  box -- and the generic handler lowercases for display, so the header
  still read "latex" and the miss looked like a hit
- a whole LaTeX document was being typeset as an expression: 100% of
  commands unknown and the prose run together, which is worse than the
  code block it replaced. renderMathBlock now declines and hands the
  fence back to the ordinary code-block path.

test-math-render.mjs: 141 -> 178 assertions
